type: dataset
title: "US Airline Reliability Dataset — 2026 H1"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-20"
abstract: >-
  An extract from the US Department of Transportation's Air Travel
  Consumer Report (August 2026 edition) for the 9 major US airlines,
  January-June 2026: on-time performance, cancellation rates,
  mishandled baggage, and involuntary denied boarding, plus a
  year-over-year comparison and Spirit Airlines' monthly breakdown
  before it ceased operations. Built for the Kibbo Research
  investigation ranking which airline performed worst in 2026 H1.
